 '## Submission interface and artifacts','',f"The final ZIP is **{manifest['zip_bytes']:,} bytes compressed / {manifest['unpacked_bytes']:,} bytes uncompressed**, one skill root, standard library plus course package only. SHA-256: `{manifest['zip_sha256']}`. Source, ZIP and extracted tree hashes agree. F2’s 56-game extraction reproduction matched all **56 outcomes and 56 complete action traces**; reproduction games are not new holdout samples.",'',
